&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:bottom;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="bottom"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;（単位：千円）&lt;/p&gt;
